# A winter yard print (issue 076, from one of Marc's unhung pieces): a thin pale border, a hazy grey sky over deep snow, a dark horse cart with spoked wheels in the middle, a broken fence on the left, a faint bush, and on the right a bare dark tree with a few red buds. Grey, white and near-black with a pinch of red. An abstract impression, not a pixel copy. 32x16 wall slot (table and desk walls).
size: 32x16
